!demo/assets/generated_music/demo_*.mp3
!demo/assets/videos/demo_preview.mp4

# ============================================================================
# NOTES FOR DEVELOPERS
# ============================================================================

# This .gitignore is designed to protect:
# 1. Proprietary algorithms and trained models
# 2. Commercial licensing information  
# 3. Customer data and configurations
# 4. Personal research and development files
# 5. System-specific optimizations and secrets
#
# While allowing:
# 1. Public interfaces and architectures
# 2. Demo implementations and examples
# 3. Documentation and educational content
# 4. Open-source utility functions
# 5. Portfolio-worthy code samples
#
# Always review files before committing to ensure no proprietary
# content is accidentally included in public repositories.
